<title>UK: LGT adds to fixed income team in London.</title>
<headline>LGT adds to fixed income team in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>LGT Asset Management has added to its fixed income team in London with the appointment of Michael Mabbutt, a statement on Tuesday said.</p>
<p>Mabbutt joins from Barings to manage emerging market bond portfolios, particularly in Eastern Europe. He will join Paul Griffiths, who heads developed country debt, and report to Simon Nocera, based in the U.S., who is overall head of emerging markets fixed income.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
